# Normalise author / committer identities for `git log`, `git shortlog` and the
# Contributors graph.
#
# GitHub's canonical noreply form is "<numeric-id>+<login>@users.noreply.github.com".
# An earlier commit used the login-only form (which GitHub cannot link to an
# account) and one used a personal address; both are folded into the canonical one.
